# Copy this file to .env.secrets and fill in real values.
# .env.secrets is gitignored and overrides configs/qbittorrent/.env.
# PASSWORD is not here: the container reads its WebUI credential from a
# PBKDF2 hash in qBittorrent.conf (set live via the API by rotate-passwords.sh),
# not from env. The value shared with the exporter and homepage lives in
# configs/qbittorrent/secrets/password.txt instead. See
# docs/COMPOSE_CONVENTIONS.md.
